<title>SRI LANKA: Sathosa 12-mth net slips.</title>
<headline>Sathosa 12-mth net slips.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Sathosa Motors Ltd, for the 12 months ended March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			   1997	    1996</p>
<p>    Turnover	  628.11   vs   678.60</p>
<p>    Net profit	 36.86   vs    37.46</p>
<p>    Tax provision    24.57   vs    28.36</p>
<p>NOTE - Sathosa Motors Ltd is the Sri Lankan agent for Isuzu and Opel motor vehicles.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
